{
    "_comment": [
        "Offline configuration. Two rules govern the URLs in this file.",
        "",
        "1. Everything here is BROWSER-facing, so paths are root-relative.",
        "   That is deliberate: a relative path follows whatever origin the",
        "   page was loaded from, so the app keeps working if the box is",
        "   reached as localhost, as a LAN IP, or through another proxy.",
        "",
        "2. The STAC catalog is the exception and uses absolute hrefs built",
        "   from PUBLIC_ORIGIN at seed time, because those same hrefs are read",
        "   server-side by the MCP server and rewritten to s3:// for DuckDB.",
        "   A relative path is meaningless to a process with no page origin.",
        "   Consequence: PUBLIC_ORIGIN must match the URL in the address bar,",
        "   or child collections 404 while this top-level file looks fine.",
        "",
        "Features off on purpose, not by oversight: geocoder (Nominatim and",
        "Photon are both remote), voice transcription (needs a speech model",
        "this box does not ship), and upload (writes to object storage that is",
        "read-only here). See docs/offline.md.",
        "",
        "3. `geocoder.enabled: false` must be stated, not implied. Upstream",
        "   computes `geoCfg.enabled !== false`, so an ABSENT geocoder block",
        "   leaves the `geocode` agent tool REGISTERED, and the agent then",
        "   calls nominatim.openstreetmap.org mid-conversation — a live network",
        "   dependency at request time, which is the one thing this box must",
        "   not have. Omitting a key is not the same as disabling a feature;",
        "   check the upstream default before trusting an absence."
    ],

    "catalog": "/data/geo-data/stac/catalog.json",
    "titiler_url": "/titiler",
    "mcp_url": "/mcp",

    "auto_approve": true,
    "upload_enabled": false,
    "draw_enabled": true,
    "charts": { "enabled": true },
    "geolocate": { "button": false, "agent_tool": false },
    "geocoder": { "enabled": false, "search_box": false },

    "sidebar": { "enabled": true, "chat_title": "Ask about US census data" },

    "view": { "center": [-98.5, 39.5], "zoom": 4 },

    "links": {
        "github": "https://github.com/SchmidtDSE/glen-in-a-box",
        "carbon": false
    },

    "welcome": {
        "message": "This is a fully offline copy of the US census explorer — the map, the database, and the language model all run on this machine, with no internet connection. Try asking:",
        "examples": [
            "Which five states have the highest median household income?",
            "Show me counties where more than 20% of people live below the poverty line.",
            "Color the counties by population density and tell me the ten densest.",
            "How does median income vary across census tracts in Los Angeles County?"
        ]
    },

    "collections": [
        {
            "collection_id": "us-census-states",
            "collection_url": "/data/geo-data/stac/us-census-states/collection.json",
            "group": "Census geographies",
            "assets": [
                {
                    "id": "pmtiles",
                    "display_name": "States",
                    "visible": true,
                    "default_style": {
                        "fill-color": "#000000",
                        "fill-opacity": 0
                    },
                    "outline_style": {
                        "line-color": "#37474F",
                        "line-width": 1.2
                    },
                    "tooltip_fields": ["NAME", "STUSPS", "pop_total", "median_income"]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "collection_id": "us-census-counties",
            "collection_url": "/data/geo-data/stac/us-census-counties/collection.json",
            "group": "Census geographies",
            "assets": [
                {
                    "id": "pmtiles",
                    "display_name": "Counties — median household income",
                    "visible": true,
                    "default_style": {
                        "fill-color": [
                            "step",
                            ["coalesce", ["get", "median_income"], -1],
                            "#E0E0E0",
                            0, "#FEE5D9",
                            45000, "#FCAE91",
                            60000, "#FB6A4A",
                            80000, "#DE2D26",
                            105000, "#A50F15"
                        ],
                        "fill-opacity": 0.8
                    },
                    "outline_style": {
                        "line-color": "#FFFFFF",
                        "line-width": 0.3,
                        "line-opacity": 0.6
                    },
                    "tooltip_fields": ["NAME", "STUSPS", "pop_total", "median_income", "pop_density"],
                    "legend_type": "categorical",
                    "legend_classes": [
                        { "label": "No data", "color": "#E0E0E0" },
                        { "label": "under $45k", "color": "#FEE5D9" },
                        { "label": "$45k – $60k", "color": "#FCAE91" },
                        { "label": "$60k – $80k", "color": "#FB6A4A" },
                        { "label": "$80k – $105k", "color": "#DE2D26" },
                        { "label": "$105k and over", "color": "#A50F15" }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "collection_id": "us-census-tracts",
            "collection_url": "/data/geo-data/stac/us-census-tracts/collection.json",
            "group": "Census geographies",
            "assets": [
                {
                    "id": "pmtiles",
                    "display_name": "Census tracts — median household income",
                    "visible": false,
                    "default_style": {
                        "fill-color": [
                            "step",
                            ["coalesce", ["get", "median_income"], -1],
                            "#E0E0E0",
                            0, "#EFF3FF",
                            45000, "#BDD7E7",
                            60000, "#6BAED6",
                            80000, "#3182BD",
                            105000, "#08519C"
                        ],
                        "fill-opacity": 0.85
                    },
                    "tooltip_fields": ["GEOID", "NAMELSAD", "pop_total", "median_income"],
                    "legend_type": "categorical",
                    "legend_classes": [
                        { "label": "No data", "color": "#E0E0E0" },
                        { "label": "under $45k", "color": "#EFF3FF" },
                        { "label": "$45k – $60k", "color": "#BDD7E7" },
                        { "label": "$60k – $80k", "color": "#6BAED6" },
                        { "label": "$80k – $105k", "color": "#3182BD" },
                        { "label": "$105k and over", "color": "#08519C" }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
